# native/orig4/orig4.pin: every input of the ORIG-4 shadow advisor unit, by hash.
# tests/orig4/run.sh refuses to build unless each line below matches what it materializes.
# omc <sha256>: this repository's seeded compiler, seed/out/omc (seed/out/omc.sha256).
# unit <order> <repo> <commit> <path> <sha256>: a pinned .om source taken with
#   git -C <repo dir> show <commit>:<path>; repo "omega" is this repository (the commit must
#   be an ancestor of HEAD), "aien-train" is the sibling clone ../aien-train (the gate step
#   materializes it under build/pins at the one commit every aien-train unit names, a
#   commit on aien-train main, and points the glue there). The unit is the concatenation in
#   <order>, then native/orig4/shadow.om and the caller. Units 1-2 are omega-bridge
#   native/ref32 add32.om/mul32.om (7e1d0d61), taken from their byte-identical reviewed copy
#   on aien-train main (evidence/ECOSYSTEM6/ref32-review/source, SHA256SUMS there).
# image <file> <sha256>: an immutable candidate checkpoint under native/orig4/candidates
#   (byte-identical to aien-train evidence/SI19-ORIG2/candidates at the pinned commit).
omc 469532a50ecb8a0e5ca8e914dd46754bb3fbde7825fb33b7037208caf09779bc
